  (text "USB_SEL: 0=A, 1=C. /OE pulled HIGH disables all data at reset.\nFirmware only enables after selected VBUS is valid; stop on disconnect/port change.\nBoth plugs must never join D+/D- directly. No USB PD and no source VBUS."
    (at 270 239 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3)
      )
    )
    (uuid "4a6d26cd-b2b9-5801-8626-037f6febb26b")
  )
  (text "CC and VBUS TVS fitted; verify leakage and clamp coordination.\nUSB-A plug and USB-C footprints remain unselected.\nGND is common; simultaneous hosts are not galvanically isolated."
    (at 92 250 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3)
      )
    )
    (uuid "77b9ba99-3ab3-58bc-9d9d-3da231b9529e")
